{
  "id": "EXO.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "EXO",
  "reference": "Wuok 27",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedo mar kendo mar misango miwangʼo pep",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ger kendo mar misango gi yiend siala, ma borne madhi malo romo fut angʼwen gi nus, lachne kod borne mondo obed fut abiriyo gi nus maromre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Los tungʼ e konde angʼwen mag kendono, mondo omi tungego kod kendo mar misango obed gimoro achiel ka kendono omuon wiye gi mula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gik moko duto mitiyogo e kendo mar misango los gi mula. Gigo ne gin agulni ma ijowogo buru, opawo, bakunde mikirogo remo, gi uma michiwogo ringʼo kod tegni mag mach.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Losne singʼenge mar mula kendo ilos nyange mag mula kendo iketgi achiel achiel e kondene angʼwen-go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kete e bwo ndiri molworo kendo mar misango kendo ochopi nyaka e kor kendo mar misangono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Los ludhe mag yiend siala ni kendo mar misangono kendo ibawgi gi mula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ludhego noso e nyangeyego mondo gibedi e bath kendo mar misangono kitingʼego.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Los kendo mar misangono gi bao mayom, to ituch bugo e chuny sandukuno mondo iwe iye obed thuolo, kendo lose mana kaka nonyisi ewi got.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Laru mar Hemb Romo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Los laru ne Hemb Romono. Yo milambo mar laruno borne norom mita piero angʼwen gauchiel kendo onego obed gi pasia momin molos gi law mayom,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bende obed gi sirni piero ariyo gi rachungi piero ariyo mag mula kod ramaki mag fedha kod rangʼaw miriwogo sirnigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma odok yo nyandwat mar laruno nobed maromo mita piero angʼwen gauchiel kendo nobed gi pasia mongʼaw e sirni piero ariyo kendo morwak e rachungi piero ariyo mag mula; ramaki kod rangʼaw miriwogo kor sirni molos gi fedha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Koma odok yo podho chiengʼ mar laruno lachne norom mita piero ariyo gadek kendo nobed gi pasia mongʼaw e sirni apar morwakie rachungi apar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma odok yo wuok chiengʼ mar laruno lachne norom mita piero ariyo gadek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pasia ma borgi romo mita abiriyo nobed e dir rangach konchiel, ka pasiago ongʼaw ewi sirni adek man-gi rachungi adek;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo pasia ma borgi romo mita abiriyo nobedi e dir rangach komachielo kongʼawgi e sirni adek man-gi rachungi adek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"To e dhoranga laruno, ketie pasia mar law mayom momin ma borne romo mita ochiko kendo man-gi rangi marambulu gi maralik kod makwar duto molos gi jachwecho molony koketgi ewi sirni angʼwen man-gi rachungi angʼwen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sirnigo duto molworo laruno nobed gi ramaki gi rangʼaw molos gi fedha kaachiel gi rachungi mag mula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laruno borne norom fut mia achiel gi piero abich, to lachne norom fut piero abiriyo gabich kendo borne modhi malo en fut abiriyo gi nus gi pasia molos gi law mayom kendo rachungi duto nyaka bed mag mula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gik moko duto mag tich e Hemb Romo, bed ni gin gik ma itiyogo tich moro amora, to gi loye duto mag hema kaachiel gi loye mag laru nyaka losgi gi mula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mo mar rachungi taya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Chik jo-Israel mondo gikelni mo maliw mar zeituni mobi mondo omi teyni osik kaliel ma ok otho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harun gi yawuote nyaka neni teynigo osiko kaliel e nyim Jehova Nyasaye chakre odhiambo nyaka okinyi, ka gikete e Hemb Romo oko mar pasia mantiere e nyim Sandug Muma. Ma en chik mosiko nyaka chiengʼ ne jo-Israel nyaka ne tienge duto mabiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
